DESCRIPTION >
    Versioned current-state projection of ActiveCampaign tag definitions.

SCHEMA >
    `tag_id` String `json:$.tag_id`,
    `tag_name` Nullable(String) `json:$.tag_name`,
    `tag_created_at` Nullable(DateTime64(6)) `json:$.tag_created_at`,
    `source_version` DateTime64(6) `json:$.source_version`,
    `is_deleted` UInt8 `json:$.is_deleted`

ENGINE ReplacingMergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY tag_id
ENGINE_VER source_version
